<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Team2026 - Landing Page</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #0d6efd;
            --bg: #f4f7ff;
            --text: #1f2937;
            --muted: #6b7280;
            --card: #fff;
            --shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, #eef3ff 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .navbar {
            width: 100%;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
        }
        .brand { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.05em; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #0f172a; text-decoration: none; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }
        .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: #374151; font-weight: 500; padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 0.45rem; transition: 0.2s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { background: #eef2ff; color: #1d4ed8; }
        .nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
        .btn { border: none; border-radius: 0.45rem; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white; padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem; }
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: #1f2937; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem; }
        .hero { text-align: center; padding: 5rem 1rem 2rem; }
        .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.1rem); margin: 0; color: #0b1f52; }
        .hero p { font-size: 1rem; max-width: 760px; margin: 1rem auto 0; color: #4b5563; }
        .hero .hero-btns { margin-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 0.7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .hero .hero-btns .btn { padding: 0.7rem 1.1rem; }
        .features { max-width: 1100px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
        .card { background: var(--card); border-radius: 0.8rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 1.1rem; border: 1px solid #edf2ff; }
        .card h3 { margin: 0 0 0.4rem; color: #0f172a; }
        .card p { margin: 0; color: #4b5563; font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .footer { margin-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 1.2rem 1rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #6b7280; }
        @media (max-width: 840px) {
            .nav-container { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: center; }
            .nav-links { order: 2; width: 100%; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
            .hero { padding-top: 3rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="#" class="brand">Team2026</a>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#about">About Us</a>
                <a href="#help">Help Us</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-actions">
                <input type="search" placeholder="Search..." style="border-radius:.45rem;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;padding:.35rem .55rem;outline:none;" aria-label="Search" />
                <button class="btn btn-outline">Login</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section class="hero" id="home">
            <p style="color:#2563eb;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.75rem;margin-bottom:.5rem;">Launch your site in minutes</p>
            <h1>Grow with a limit</h1>
            <p>Create a stunning, fast-loading website with a simple layout, strong brand style, and clear call-to-action. Perfect for startups, agencies, and portfolios.</p>
            <div class="hero-btns">
                <button class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</button>
                <button class="btn btn-outline">Book a Demo</button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="features">
            <article class="card" id="about">
                <h3>About Us</h3>
                <p>We build high-converting landing pages that look beautiful and work smoothly across devices.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card" id="help">
                <h3>Help Us</h3>
                <p>Check our support docs, FAQ, and tutorials to set up quickly and avoid common issues.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card" id="contact">
                <h3>Contact Us</h3>
                <p>Need assistance? Reach our team via contact form, email, or live chat and get fast support.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card">
                <h3>Secure Login</h3>
                <p>Sign in to your dashboard securely with password protection and multi-factor authentication.</p>
            </article>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
        © 2026 Team2026. Built for quick landing pages and modern web experiences.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
